]  \n   - Du kan også laste opp XSD direkte til `<org>-datamodels`-repoet hvis du bare vil lagre filen og ikke redigere den i verktøyet. [2]\n\nHvis du mener **organisasjonsdatamodeller**, ligger de i `<org>-datamodels`-repoet, og du trenger tilgang som medlem av **Data models**-teamet for å redigere dem. [2][3]\n\nHvis du vil, kan jeg også gi deg en helt kort steg-for-steg-oppskrift for enten **ny modell** eller **opplasting av XSD**.", :search-errors [], :search-passes 3}, :error nil, :id "altinn-studio-datamodeling", :improved false, :query "Hvordan definerer jeg en datamodell i Altinn Studio v8?", :regressed false, :relaxed {:answer-pass true, :budget-state {:low-read-budget? false, :low-search-budget? false, :max-read-content-length 16000, :max-read-operations 6, :max-search-passes 4, :read-content-budget-exhausted? false, :read-content-length-remaining 7909, :read-content-length-used 8091, :read-operations-exhausted? false, :read-operations-remaining 2, :read-operations-used 4, :search-budget-exhausted? false, :search-passes-remaining 2, :search-passes-used 2}, :durations-ms {:total 21391.906042}, :error nil, :golden-present false, :inspection {:largest-read {:chunk-ids ["1b01e940366f" "ad84e478aa32" "6fe25fb74adf"], :content-length 4609, :mode :chunk-ids, :operation 3, :returned-chunks [{:chunk-id "1b01e940366f", :chunk-index 0, :content-length 452, :doc-num "98c4e6acf97c", :title "Data modeling"} {:chunk-id "ad84e478aa32", :chunk-index 1, :content-length 1082, :doc-num "d0ee8bb8a189", :title "Data modeling"} {:chunk-id "6fe25fb74adf", :chunk-index 2, :content-length 3075, :doc-num "1ba467f9722a", :title "Altinn 2 datamodel"}], :returned-count 3}, :reads [{:chunk-ids ["071cbb5c2747" "9690d6108ad6"], :content-length 1281, :mode :chunk-ids, :operation 1, :returned-chunks [{:chunk-id "071cbb5c2747", :chunk-index 4, :content-length 844, :doc-num "d0ee8bb8a189", :title "Data modeling"} {:chunk-id "9690d6108ad6", :chunk-index 0, :content-length 437, :doc-num "1ba46